IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `qld-part02-meaning-of-act`

-- Tests for Part 2 (qld-part02-meaning-of-act.l4).

§ `Tests of Part 2`

-- s 6(1): an Act of the Queensland Parliament; or a British or NSW Act in force in Queensland; or an enactment of an earlier authority that received assent.
#ASSERT `a thing is an Act (s 6(1))` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `a thing is an Act (s 6(1))` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `a thing is an Act (s 6(1))` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- "Means" closes the definition.
#ASSERT `a thing is an Act (s 6(1))` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- s 6(2): the reference includes the Act in which the reference is; "includes" leaves the rest open.
#ASSERT `a reference to an Act includes the Act in which the reference is (s 6(2))` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `a reference to an Act includes the Act in which the reference is (s 6(2))` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 7(1) and (2).
#ASSERT `a reference to a law or provision includes the statutory instruments under it (s 7(1))` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `a reference to a law or provision includes the statutory instruments under it (s 7(1))` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `law in s 7(1) includes a law of the Commonwealth, another State or a Territory (s 7(2))` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `law in s 7(1) includes a law of the Commonwealth, another State or a Territory (s 7(2))` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
